sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Merchant as Merchant System
    participant Gateway as API Gateway
    participant PayoutSvc as Payout Service
    participant Ledger as Double-Entry Ledger
    participant Router as Smart Routing Engine
    participant RailSPI as Domestic Rail SPI (FedNow / BI-FAST)
    participant Switch as Central Bank Switch / Domestic Clearing

    Note over Merchant,Gateway: Step 1: Beneficiary Account Probe
    Merchant->>Gateway: POST /v1/payouts/validate-beneficiary {bank_code, account_no}
    Gateway->>PayoutSvc: ValidateBeneficiary()
    PayoutSvc->>RailSPI: validateBeneficiary()
    RailSPI->>Switch: ISO 20022 camt.059 Account Probe Request
    Switch-->>RailSPI: camt.060 Probe Response (Account Holder: "PT MAJU PERKASA")
    RailSPI-->>PayoutSvc: BeneficiaryVerified
    PayoutSvc-->>Gateway: 200 OK {is_valid: true, account_name: "PT MAJU PERKASA"}
    Gateway-->>Merchant: Beneficiary Name Confirmed

    Note over Merchant,Gateway: Step 2: Payout Initiation & Idempotency Locking
    Merchant->>Gateway: POST /v1/payouts (Idempotency-Key: "idemp_8921", amount: $5,000)
    Gateway->>PayoutSvc: SubmitPayout()
    PayoutSvc->>Ledger: HoldFunds(MerchantAvailableAccount, $5,000)
    Ledger-->>PayoutSvc: HoldConfirmed(ReservationId: "res_9941")

    Note over PayoutSvc,Router: Step 3: Routing & Rail Dispatch
    PayoutSvc->>Router: EvaluateRoute(destination_bank, $5,000)
    Router-->>PayoutSvc: SelectedRail: BI_FAST (Instant, Fee: $0.15)
    PayoutSvc->>RailSPI: dispatchPayout(pacs.008 Credit Transfer)
    RailSPI->>Switch: pacs.008.001.08 Credit Transfer (EndToEndId: "E2E-20261110-01")
    Switch-->>RailSPI: Synchronous ACK (HTTP 202 Accepted)

    Note over Switch,PayoutSvc: Step 4: Asynchronous Clearing Confirmation
    Switch-->>RailSPI: Async pacs.002.001.10 Payment Status (Status: ACCP/Settled)
    RailSPI->>PayoutSvc: PayoutSettledNotification
    PayoutSvc->>Ledger: CommitHold("res_9941", BankTransitAccount)
    Ledger-->>PayoutSvc: HoldCommittedJournaled
    PayoutSvc-->>Merchant: Signed CloudEvent Webhook (payout.settled)
